        "How does the concept of the 'consecrated vessel' — emptied of common use to be filled with sacred purpose — illuminate the spiritual purpose of fasting?",
        "Isaiah 58:6-7 redefines fasting from a religious exercise to a lifestyle of justice and compassion. How does this challenge the way you have traditionally thought about fasting?",
        "Jesus said 'when' you fast, not 'if' (Matthew 6:16). Why do you think fasting is so rarely practiced among modern Christians, and what might we be missing as a result?",
